The Komorebi-specific modifications, application name, icon artwork, guide
images, UI text, packaging configuration, and newly added source files are
copyrighted by Misakamiro and Komorebi contributors.

Unless a separate written permission is granted by the copyright holder, you may
not use the Komorebi name, icon, character artwork, guide images, or other
branding assets to publish an unofficial build that may be confused with the
official Komorebi project.

## Upstream FFBox-derived code

Komorebi contains code derived from FFBox. The original FFBox license and terms
are preserved in:

`licenses/FFBox-LICENSE.txt`

Any use, redistribution, or modification of FFBox-derived portions must also
comply with the upstream FFBox terms.

## Bundled third-party tools

Komorebi may be distributed with FFmpeg / FFprobe and ncmdump binaries. These
tools remain under their own upstream licenses:

- FFmpeg: `tools/LICENSE-ffmpeg.txt` and `tools/README-ffmpeg.txt`
- ncmdump: `tools/LICENSE-ncmdump.txt`

